<p>Hi <%= @user.short_name %>,</p>
<p>
  Someone requested a password reset for your USAN Event Liaison Tracker account. If this was
  you, set a new password below - this link expires in 15 minutes:
</p>
<p style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <%= link_to "Reset your password", edit_password_url(@user.generate_token_for(:password_reset)),
        style: "background: #1f4d2b; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px;" %>
</p>
<p>
  If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email - your password won't change
  unless you visit the link above and set a new one.
</p>
